  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A parallel beam of monochromatic light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> passes through a rectangular slit of width <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b\"></span> and is incident on a screen at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> from the slit.</p>\n<p>What is the width of the central maximum of the diffraction pattern on the screen?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda}{b}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2\\lambda}{b}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{λ x}{b}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2 λ x}{b}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
